Enable 47-bit TTBR0 (T0SZ=17, 4-level L0->L1->L2->L3) with 38-bit TTBR1 (T1SZ=26) on 4K arm64e macOS.

Hardware evidence:
- pl21 (T0SZ=26): panic pmap_enter_options_internal: attempt to map illegal VA 0x73e200040000
- pl32 (T0SZ=25): TB710FU PID1 FAULT: pc=0x18f4f53ec lr=0x17344c818f4f5608 far=0x4d81fc9e4bd8
